@startuml 18_state_mobile
[*] --> LOADING
LOADING --> READY : API data received
LOADING --> EMPTY : API returns no registered hosts
LOADING --> ERROR : timeout / API failure
READY --> REFRESHING : 5s poll
REFRESHING --> READY : updated data
REFRESHING --> ERROR : failed fetch
ERROR --> LOADING : retry
EMPTY --> LOADING : refresh
@enduml
